00 patients at a median follow-up of 37 months in the ATAC trial (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="bib33">Howell, 2003</xref>; <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="bib40">Locker and Eastell, 2003</xref>)</title></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>6-monthly fracture rates/100 patients</bold><hr/></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Time (months)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Anastrozole (<italic>n</italic>=3092)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Tamoxifen (<italic>n</italic>=3093)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Anastrozole/tamoxifen 6-month hazard ratio</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"> 6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.11</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.99</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.14</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">12</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.93</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.58</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.61</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">18</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.36</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.69</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.98</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">24</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.57</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.61</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.57</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">30</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.39</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.96</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.45</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">36</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.09</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.66</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.66</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">42</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.50</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.37</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.09</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">48</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.07</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.80</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.34</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><p>ATAC trial=Arimidex, Tamoxifen Alone or in Combination trial.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>